      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "How many people would use that feature? I don't see it being a good idea. Running VRChat on mobile is already going to be a challenge.\n\nSome people you can show this experience to add they are interested in something better, but I think this might be better at scaring people away from the tech.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
