  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-07-18T21:42:13.555Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Along with Bluetooth remote support I think in the settings there should be a \"Glass\" Option which opens up a dual screened mode that is ran off of only the gyroscope in the phone. Yes it would only be 3DOF (three degrees of freedom) but I used to play exactly like this by connecting my phone to my PC through third party apps like iVRy and it was decent enough and still delivered the fun of VR to me with a very low budget when I was younger. I think it will be a great edition to the upcoming Android Port and I hope you agree!",
